type: software
title: "Motor-de-Velos-SCM: Reproducible Pipeline for SCM Galaxy Rotation Curve Analysis"
authors:
  - family-names: Cámara Madrid
    given-names: Sergio
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000
repository-code: https://github.com/sergiocamaramadrid-cyber/Motor-de-Velos-SCM
url: https://github.com/sergiocamaramadrid-cyber/Motor-de-Velos-SCM
abstract: >-
  Motor-de-Velos-SCM provides a reproducible, auditable pipeline to evaluate
  galaxy rotation curves under the SCM (Motor de Velos; Fluid Condensation)
  model. The repository implements end-to-end workflows covering data
  preprocessing, out-of-sample validation, OLS environmental analysis
  (F3 vs. stellar mass and Chae environment proxy), and diagnostic reporting.
  Validated datasets include SPARC (Lelli et al. 2016) and LITTLE THINGS.
keywords:
  - galaxy rotation curves
  - SPARC
  - MOND
  - fluid condensation model
  - SCM
  - baryonic Tully-Fisher
  - statistical astronomy
  - reproducible research
